# Names that must never reach a commit: your customers, your products, your repos,
# your agents' ids, the tools your project happens to use.
#
# Copy this to `.private-terms`, which is gitignored — the real list must not be
# published, since it would be exactly the leak the hook exists to prevent.
#
# One per line, case-insensitive, matched as a plain substring. `#` comments allowed.

